  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "intro",
      "from": 0,
      "to": 4,
      "bars": "1-2",
      "brief": "No drums. Dark, tense, rising: low pad drone, filtered noise swell, sparse sub heartbeat, risers. Ticks from the sfx layer carry the rhythm."
    },
    {
      "name": "drop-A",
      "from": 4,
      "to": 8,
      "bars": "3-4",
      "brief": "Logo hit at 4.0: kick + sub bass + pad chord + gentle plucked arp enter. Confident, clean, modern tech-product feel."
    },
    {
      "name": "groove-A",
      "from": 8,
      "to": 14,
      "bars": "5-7",
      "brief": "Steady groove while the user types: hats on off-beats, soft shaker, bass pattern, arp gets busier. Leave space for the key clicks."
    },
    {
      "name": "build",
      "from": 14,
      "to": 20,
      "bars": "8-10",
      "brief": "Energy climbs through the 8 swipes (they land on the beat from 17.5 on): add snare/clap fills, rising filter, tighter arps."
    },
    {
      "name": "counter",
      "from": 20,
      "to": 22,
      "bars": "11",
      "brief": "Riser: kick drops out at 21.0, snare roll accelerating into 22.0, everything cuts for a beat of air right before the hit."
    },
    {
      "name": "drop-B",
      "from": 22,
      "to": 26,
      "bars": "12-13",
      "brief": "Biggest moment: full chord stack + lead melody + open hats + kick. Celebratory but tasteful."
    },
    {
      "name": "email",
      "from": 26,
      "to": 34,
      "bars": "14-17",
      "brief": "Breakdown: low-pass the groove, warm keys + pad, soft pulse; light percussion. The notif-ping and code-ding sit on top."
    },
    {
      "name": "system",
      "from": 34,
      "to": 37.6,
      "bars": "18-19",
      "brief": "Rhythmic, techy: staccato arps / gated pad pulsing with the nodes (they come faster now: 5 nodes in 1.4 s, tiles at 35.8-36.2, locks 36.55 / 36.95); the groove stops cleanly at 37.5 when the diagram is pushed away."
    },
    {
      "name": "human",
      "from": 37.6,
      "to": 40,
      "bars": "20",
      "brief": "Warm, human, quiet: the groove is gone. Soft pad + felt/e-piano chords on G (V) leaning towards C, a little air, maybe a single gentle bell on the redeem-ding. Paper-bag rustle at 38.0 is a real, close, tactile sound: keep the music out of its way. Build a gentle lift into the downbeat at 40.0 (no drums, no riser clichés)."
    },
    {
      "name": "outro",
      "from": 40,
      "to": 44.5,
      "bars": "21-22+",
      "brief": "The handshake lands on the downbeat of bar 21 (40.0): THIS is the song's big resolving C chord (full, warm, the biggest moment of the film besides the 98 % hit). Let it ring through bar 22 (Cadd9 at 42.0); the logo-hit-soft at 41.0 is only a secondary accent on top of the held chord; chips at 42.2-42.95; sparkle 43.4; fade the tail to true silence by 44.5."
    }
  ],
